l_context_control/reader_s069_a_ayah_walk.md",459,"69:41","2. **Subtle awareness fails to become assent.** **ش ع ر B005** (subtle knowing and awareness) is latently activated beside negated **ء م ن B002** (trusting assent and confirmation). The packet supplies minimal faith and a root that can denote fine perception; I infer that aesthetic or subtle sensing is insufficient unless it becomes trusting confirmation. This is exploratory because `شاعر` directly selects B007."],["a-s069-0227","v12/runs_11ayah/s069/full_context_control/reader_s069_a_ayah_walk.md",103,"69:7","2. **Persons become fallen timber.** `ص ر ع` B007 is \"a fallen or dried branch used as material\"; `ع ج ز` B004 is \"the rear or hind part of a thing\"; `ن خ ل` B001 is the date palm. The simile immediately turns the human `صَرْعَىٰ` into palm rears/trunks. B007 assigns the bodies the role of detached material, while B004 selects the leftover base rather than a living crown. The packet gives the simile; I infer that deanimation is its causal work: people -> unusable or discarded timber. The reading changes from visual resemblance to a material demotion of social bodies."],["a-s069-0001","v12/runs_11ayah/s069/full_context_control/reader_s069_a_ayah_walk.md",289,"69:20","69:26's `وَلَمْ أَدْرِ مَا حِسَابِيَهْ` creates the decisive contrast unavailable in the local window: serious expectation, whether B001 certainty or B003 uncertainty, differs functionally from non-orientation and confessed ignorance. The late `ي ق ن` B001 in 69:51 confirms the certainty branch without erasing the risk-bearing branch; both prepared the successful speaker for encounter."],["a-s069-0002","v12/runs_11ayah/s069/full_context_control/reader_s069_a_ayah_walk.md",289,"69:20","69:26's `وَلَمْ أَدْرِ مَا حِسَابِيَهْ` creates the decisive contrast unavailable in the local window: serious expectation, whether B001 certainty or B003 uncertainty, differs functionally from non-orientation and confessed ignorance. The late `ي ق ن` B001 in 69:51 confirms the certainty branch without erasing the risk-bearing branch; both prepared the successful speaker for encounter."],["a-s069-0021","v12/runs_11ayah/s069/full_context_control/reader_s069_a_ayah_walk.md",460,"69:33","2. **Greatness becomes the force that overwhelms failed human authority.** `ع ظ م` B001 is \"greatness and strength\" and B007 is \"finding something overwhelming\"; `ء ل ه` B001 is \"worship and the worshipped one.\" The divine adjective follows 69:29's ruined `سُلْطَان` and the commands that master the person's body. B001 assigns greatness to the worshipped referent; B007 assigns the accused person's eventual experience of that greatness. The packet gives failed human force and effective divine command; I infer a scale reversal. `ٱلْعَظِيمِ` reads not as decorative praise but as operative greatness that exceeds the authority he relied on."]]}
